The facts-about-me list held every unretracted fact about a person's numbers,
including a saver's private notes and needs, which are that saver's own words
(the frontend's 14:35Z question). Misho, 15 Oct: hide the private ones. The
list and the removal now cover facts marked public, and facts read from a
public page or a number's saved name; a hidden fact answers not-found, so its
existence is not disclosed. FOR_FRONTEND answers the frontend.

